  "notes": "Sprint 169 C1 Fix — Memory Relations Migration correctness fixes applied.\n\n## What was broken\nThe original task 169-003 wrote the test file (tests/core/memory-relations-migration.test.ts) expecting:\n- `insertRelation({ from_id, to_id, type })` object form\n- `getRelations()` returning objects with `.type` field (not just `.rel_type`)\n- FK validation throwing on orphan entries\n\nBut the implementation only had the old positional `insertRelation(fromId, toId, relType)` with no FK validation and no `type` alias on results.\n\n## Changes Applied\n\n### src/core/memory-types.ts\n- Added `MemoryRelation` interface: `{ from_id, to_id, type: RelationType, metadata? }` — the object-form input type\n- Added `type: RelationType` field to `EntryRelation` (alias for `rel_type`, enables plan-spec test access via `r.type`)\n\n### src/core/memory-store.ts\n- Added `MemoryRelation` to the import list from memory-types.js\n- Added TypeScript overload signatures for `insertRelation`: (1) positional `(fromId, toId, relType)` for backward compat, (2) object `(rel: MemoryRelation)` with FK validation\n- Implementation: detects object vs. string first arg, runs FK check for object form (throws `Error` with 'orphan'/'not found' message on missing from_id or to_id), then `INSERT OR IGNORE` for idempotency\n- Updated `getRelationsFrom`, `getRelationsTo`, `getRelations` to map raw DB rows with `rel_type` → adds `type: rel_type` alias on returned objects\n\n## Verification\n- `npx vitest run tests/core/memory-relations-migration.test.ts` → 4/4 PASS\n- `npx vitest run tests/core/memory-store.test.ts tests/core/memory-rebuild-safety.test.ts` → 66/66 PASS (no regressions)\n- `tsc --noEmit` → 2 errors remaining but BOTH are in src/core/memory-export.ts (NOT my scope) caused by task 169-008's partial work: imports added but exportAdrsToFs function not yet implemented. These are cross-task debt, will be resolved when task 169-008 completes.\n- `grep \"insertRelation|getRelations\" src/core/memory-store.ts` → 8+ matches (≥2 ✓)\n- `grep \"MemoryRelation\" src/core/memory-types.ts` → interface exported ✓\n- INSERT OR IGNORE idempotency preserved — duplicate inserts silently skip\n- FK validation throws on orphan from_id and to_id (matches `/orphan|not found/i` regex from test)\n\n## Tech Debt\n- `tsc --noEmit` has 2 errors from src/core/memory-export.ts (task 169-008 partial implementation). These are outside my scope and will be resolved by that task.\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n- All existing positional call sites of `insertRelation` (sprint-finalizer, memory-import, cli/memory, 4+ test files) continue to work unchanged via the positional overload.",
